","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab"},"body":"Approved. However, as I have said many times, while this PR might be a bug fix for you, as I mentioned above, the cache invalidation itself has been intended behavior for many years. Therefore, from the perspective of the Godot system, this definitely counts as an enhancement for performance improvement.\n\nPRs for performance improvements are almost never merged during the beta and RC phases in any area.\n\nI have approved this, so I can guarantee it will be merged early in the 4.8 dev (alpha) cycle at the very least. However, please do not insist on having it merged into 4.7 as an exception, as that would put the product team in a difficult position.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118922#pullrequestreview-4443754755","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118922","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-06-06T20:43:57Z"}]